    "/apis/v1/google/ad-library/companies/ads": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Lists ads a company or advertiser is running in Google Ads Transparency, with optional topic, region, date, platform and format filters. When `topic` is `political`, `region` is required. Provide `domain` or `advertiserId`. Results are paged: while `data.page.hasMore` is true, send `data.page.nextCursor` as `cursor` to get the next page.\n\n> **请求示例待验证。** 此接口的请求示例尚未在生产环境验证。静态示例用于说明请求格式，请替换为自己的参数。正式调用前，可用免费的报价模式（`X-AISA-Cost-Mode: quote`）查看预估费用。",
